Ad Nauseam Tendrils (ANT) storm combo: use rituals (Dark Ritual, Cabal Ritual, Lotus Petal, Lion's Eye Diamond) to generate a big mana burst, resolve Ad Nauseam or Past in Flames to refuel, build storm count, then kill with Tendrils of Agony (Infernal Tutor fetches the payoff). Dig with Brainstorm/Ponder; protect with Duress and disrupt with Cabal Therapy. Win from nowhere in one explosive turn.
